        "explanation": "The specs \"requires feed_polling_url\" and \"requires embed_by_username\" stub only one setting to nil. They don't stub feed_polling_enabled?, whose default in config/site_settings.yml is false. The job's `feed_polling_enabled? && ...` check therefore fails first, and poll_feed is never called whatever the url or username checks do. Removing the url or username guard from Jobs::PollFeed would not make either spec fail.",
